Plan for tour: Visit container then rock (in that order). Roles:
- navigator: Wait for scan results. When lidar reports a class centroid for the current target (first 'container', then 'rock'), navigate to a goal point at least 3 m from that centroid by computing goal = centroid + 3*(pose - centroid)/||pose - centroid|| using the current robot pose. If lidar reports no centroid for the current target, wait for planner to call get_occupancy_map; then drive to the planner-selected free cell (different quadrant from already-seen objects) and stop for another scan. Always stop before any sensing. After each commanded stop, wait for confirm_stop from lidar or camera before proceeding.
